---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Terms of Use"
  kicker="Legal"
  heading="Terms of Use"
  lede="The terms that govern use of this website and PRC's educational materials."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p><span class="wire" data-wire="legal-review">Draft — pending final review. Complete terms will be published before services are sold through this site.</span></p>

      <h2>Educational content</h2>
      <p>
        Content on this website — including checklists, guides, and resources — is general
        educational information about records commonly associated with events, processes,
        agencies, disputes, and transitions. It is not professional advice.
      </p>

      <h2>No professional advice</h2>
      <p>
        PRC does not provide legal advice, interpret laws, determine legal rights, make accounting
        judgments, provide medical advice, or provide social-work services. Exact requirements
        should be confirmed with the appropriate attorney, accountant, agency, court, insurer,
        lender, healthcare professional, or other qualified source. See
        <a href="/service-boundaries">Service Boundaries</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Engagements</h2>
      <p>
        Services are provided only under a written engagement with a defined scope: entities,
        properties, units, accounts, transactions, documents, users, storage volume, and review
        complexity. Nothing on this website constitutes an engagement or a guarantee of outcome.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The PRC name, the PRC Records Readiness Framework, and materials on this site belong to
        Paula Records Custodian LLC. Personal, non-commercial use of free resources is welcome;
        redistribution or commercial use requires written permission.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
